    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue</a></i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poisons\" title=\"Poisons\">Poisons</a></i> </p><p>Bundar Root causes short-term memory loss and affects a victim's ability to reason. </p><h2><span id=\"Bundar_Root_Statistics_.28CL_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bundar_Root_Statistics_(CL_1)\">Bundar Root Statistics (CL 1)</span></h2><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Keywords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keywords\">Keywords</a>:</b> Ingested, Natural, Poison </p><p><b>Trigger:</b> A creature ingests Bundar Root. </p><p><b>Attack:</b> +5 vs <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> </p><p><b>Recurrence:</b> Each round at the start of the target's turn, until the Bundar Root is treated. </p><p><b>Suggested&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a>:</b>&nbsp;The following are suggested&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a>&nbsp;for this Hazard: </p><ul>\n <li><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> (DC 15; Requires <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Medical_Kit\" title=\"Medical Kit\">Medical Kit</a>):</b> The character treats the Bundar Root.</li>\n</ul>",
